FAIR software
abstract: "A scientific and pedagogical Progressive Web Application developed for higher education institutions to monitor training loads, motor performance tests, and independent learning tasks of future sports coaches. The platform incorporates automated gamification mechanics, subjective fatigue assessments via RPE scale, standardized motor tests, and teacher-side analytics with quartile distribution and CSV reporting."
